    "reviewTitle": "Ultra soft for sure!",
    "reviewDescription": "I received Back Bay MiniPlugs Sleeping Earplugs in purple. It comes with 60 pairs of soft foam earplugs in one size intended for ages 4-11 or an adult like myself with smaller ear canals. The directions were clear and easy to understand, explaining how to properly insert them for the best seal and comfort. The product works well and reduces noise sufficiently- not as great as some others I have, but good enough for decent sleep. I really like how soft and small they are because they fit comfortably in my ears without causing pressure or pain when lying on my side. There is a storage case with a chain that was buried about halfway into the bottle. I really like the bottle too with it's resealable wooden lid. Overall, it does what it is supposed to do. I feel like this product is a good value, you get a lot for $15!",
